  "nonClaims": [
    "A profile, fixture, unsigned record, simulated restart, process termination, or virtual-machine reset is not controlled physical power-loss evidence.",
    "The verifier never initiates a shutdown, restart, power cut, signature, or witness enrollment operation.",
    "The trusted witness key and verification time must come from an authorized protected caller; evidence files cannot choose their own trust root.",
    "A local-test-build helper can exercise parser and signature logic but can emit only a fixture-only verdict.",
    "One passing attempt is scoped to the exact helper package, machine, volume, filesystem, cache class, and interruption class recorded by the signed documents.",
